  "bio": {
    "bio1": "When I was a kid, I drew perfect circles. I had no idea that my love for being precise and my natural curiosity about how things work would lead me to software.",
    "bio2": "Studying CS at <code><a href=\"https://engineering.msu.edu/academics/majors-degrees/computer-science-bs\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: var(--heading); text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;\">\n        <img src=\"icons/graduationcap.svg\" alt=\"Graduation Cap Icon\" class=\"themed-icon\" style=\"height: 0.875em; width: auto; margin-right: 0.125rem;\">MSU</a></code> and learning Swift whenever I can. My <code><a href=\"https://github.com/asahisuenaga\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: var(--heading); text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;\">\n        <img src=\"icons/text-page.svg\" alt=\"Resume Icon\" class=\"themed-icon\" style=\"height: 0.875em; width: auto; margin-right: 0.125rem;\">experience</a></code> in projects such as a <code><a href=\"https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/rainbow-cursor-in-google/nnmghknojpihdnofejbocdcnmhibkfdc\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: var(--heading); text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;\">\n        <img src=\"icons/puzzlepiece.svg\" alt=\"Puzzle Piece Icon\" class=\"themed-icon\" style=\"height: 0.875em; width: auto; margin-right: 0.125rem;\">browser extension</a></code> demonstrates this learning mindset."
  },
